  "intro": [
   "Route 66 is the road trip everybody wants to do at least once, and it turns out there's a fair bit of weird along it if you know where to look. Chicago alone has old airship sightings, the 2017 run of \"Chicago Mothman\" reports and the Lawndale giant bird case before you've even left town.",
   "After that you've got the Piasa bird and the Alton torpedo story around St. Louis, the Bigfoot on 66 festival in Missouri, and a lot of old newspaper monsters out in the California desert near the end. It's a long one (plan on a week at least, honestly more), so pick the stops that grab you."
